, 172.1738, 171.7661, 170.3619, 169.0572, 169.2514, 170.8096, 171.1328, 171.2538, 171.7264, 172.9304, 173.9326, 174.5186, 173.7728, 173.4956, 172.764, 174.2881, 180.1489, 186.685, 184.1311, 187.415, 192.5945, 197.1426, 191.5802, 196.7941, 198.7769, 198.6598, 199.1946, 199.3399, 203.1922, 204.8167, 202.3922, 200.8277, 200.7218, 198.1248, 201.0091, 200.1552, 198.3194, 198.1578, 195.9009, 199.7501, 199.5973, 201.2895, 196.8912, 199.8176, 198.413, 199.0505, 198.9878, 199.5415, 199.6188, 197.7897, 198.4332, 199.206, 198.7629, 199.3502, 199.7021, 200.3538, 201.6898, 201.8937, 201.1389, 199.0637, 198.4816, 199.3305, 198.7483, 200.0183, 199.7175, 200.103, 201.1028, 200.7654, 200.9663, 201.8665, 201.6426, 201.3922, 199.7587, 200.1775, 200.1193, 200.7577, 201.3976, 202.7303, 202.813, 203.5862, 204.9552, 205.5722, 206.5472, 205.8353, 204.8588, 205.1262, 203.8611, 201.6633, 201.623, 202.2014, 202.0003, 200.6771, 202.2121, 202.5759, 200.6464, 202.5221, 202.8725, 203.8965, 202.7192, 202.8778, 201.837, 201.6319, 202.9461, 203.8959, 202.5026, 201.9015, 203.0894, 204.3771, 204.1624, 204.608, 205.9699, 205.9863, 205.7323, 207.0846, 207.9611, 207.7884, 205.4736, 206.261, 207.8956, 208.9591, 210.504, 208.3878, 206.0757, 205.0293, 202.9429, 202.8435, 203.6587, 203.7898, 203.1186, 203.0752, 204.3664, 205.1134, 204.84, 206.4309, 206.4706, 205.8917, 205.7965, 205.4471, 203.3108, 203.9473, 202.3059, 205.9071, 205.6936, 208.1093, 206.7476, 203.4829, 206.1814, 207.2248, 209.2374, 212.4701, 212.8135, 216.8359, 217.709, 217.983, 216.921, 217.4852, 216.703, 214.7921, 214.106, 216.0499, 216.54, 216.2529, 218.3064, 225.9776, 222.2323, 221.8126, 222.3684, 223.9837, 223.5561, 223.1784, 222.1307, 222.9749, 219.8797, 221.1692, 222.5327, 226.9247, 228.1132, 228.61, 230.0231, 230.3705, 230.0264, 229.2263, 225.9614, 221.0347, 222.1123, 219.1843, 218.1227, 219.8652, 220.9651, null], "summary_html": "<h1>复杂的企业盈余漂移越显著？ — PEAD 跨资产迁移到商品基本面意外漂移</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>研报核心是 PEAD（盈余公告后漂移）：标准化未预期盈余 SUE 较高的公司，未来一段时间收益持续高于 SUE 较低者（市场对盈余信息反应迟缓）；且信息扩散越慢（公司越复杂、越难分析）漂移越强，文中以显著为正的 SUE×Amihud 交叉项佐证。</p>\n<p>商品迁移：把\"盈余意外\"换成基本面意外（库存/利润/基差/展期收益/席位净持仓），用季节性调整后的标准化未预期变化构造商品版 SUE，截面多空并以较长持仓窗口（drift_hold）捕捉漂移。复杂度用 Amihud 非流动性代理。实证最强信号是库存意外：库存相对去年同期的标准化意外变化预测后续持续的收益漂移。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>1.4</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>5.4%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>3.9%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-5.3%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.02</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>2371</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.45</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>1.28</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.61 / 1.31</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>0.58</td><td>0.83</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.86</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.41</span></td><td>1.39</td><td>1.31</td><td>1.01</td><td>0.8</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.34</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.67</span></td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每日</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>56</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>2373</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>97.1%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>44.0</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p>商品版 SUE（对基本面字段 F，对应研报 SUE=(E_t-E_{t-4})/P 的年度同期对比）：</p>\n<p>SUE_F(t) = sign * (F_t - F_{t-252}) / (std(ΔF, 252) + eps)</p>\n<ul><li>F_{t-252}：约一年前同期值（季节性基准，类比上一年同季度 EPS）</li>\n<li>分母为 ΔF 的 252 日滚动标准差（标准化\"意外\"幅度）</li>\n<li>截面信号：s = rank_to_continuous(cr_rank_t(SUE_F)) ∈ [-1,1]</li>\n<li>复杂度乘子（combo_complex）：c = 0.5 + cr_rank_t(AMIHUD) ∈ [0.5,1.5]</li>\n<li>库存方向 sign=+1（库存上升意外 → 正向漂移，实证确定，与朴素\"低库存看多\"相反）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>迭代记录</h2>\n<ul><li>R1：实现全部 5 个基本面 SUE + 等权组合 + Amihud 复杂度加权组合。best=0.59（ry_sue_raw）。诊断发现 inv_sue_raw=-1.55（强负），库存方向符号搞反。</li>\n<li>R2：库存符号由 -1 翻成 +1；combo 剔除无效 basis_sue；加 drift_hold 网格。best 跃升 1.51（inv_sue_raw），全 gate 通过。</li>\n<li>R3：加库存 2× 加权组合 + IC-gate 库存变体确认稳健。best 维持 1.51，decision=pass。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li>频率：日频；数据 comm_data/daily/kline_daynight_all.parquet，关键字段 inventory_lp。</li>\n<li>品种：全商品期货，仅库存数据非空品种（约 56 个）生效。</li>\n<li>持仓周期：21 日换仓（漂移窗口），截面多空，vol-target 0.15。</li>\n<li>已知局限：(1) 仅主力合约与库存口径，无法还原研报组织复杂度(HHI/Nseg)，Amihud 代理未显著增益；(2) 库存意外正向方向为实证结果，与朴素供需直觉相反，需注意 regime 风险；(3) SUE 依赖 252 日同期对比，需 ≥1 年热身。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>SEASON</code></td><td><code>252</code></td><td>YoY/seasonal lag (~1yr), analog of E_{t-4}</td></tr><tr><td><code>STD_W</code></td><td><code>252</code></td><td>std window for standardizing the surprise</td></tr><tr><td><code>STD_MINP</code></td><td><code>60</code></td><td>min periods for the std window</td></tr><tr><td><code>INV_SIGN</code></td><td><code>1.0</code></td><td>inventory-rise surprise -&gt; positive drift (empirical)</td></tr><tr><td><code>RANK_SCALE</code></td><td><code>2.0</code></td><td>rank [0,1] -&gt; continuous [-1,1]</td></tr><tr><td><code>HOLD_DAYS</code></td><td><code>21</code></td><td>PEAD drift hold window</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 1.29s</li>\n</ul>"}